      q: "Balance as per Cash Book is ₹50,000. A cheque of ₹5,000 deposited earlier has been dishonoured by the bank, interest of ₹1,200 has been credited by the bank, and a customer has deposited ₹3,000 directly into the account. None of these three items is yet entered in the Cash Book. What is the balance as per Pass Book?",
      value: 49200, tolerance: 0, prefix: "₹",
