      q: "Assertion (A): When a reconciliation statement is prepared starting from the balance as per Pass Book, a mistake made by the bank in the firm's account is corrected in that statement.\nReason (R): The balance printed in the Pass Book cannot be relied upon when the bank itself has posted a wrong entry.",
